The Well of Souls~
   Serapis' most horrific creatures are sprung into existence here, in the
depths of the brackish pool that fills the center of the room. A ball of light
hangs suspended by magick in the air above the pool, filling the room with a
soft glow that seems to make more shadows than it dispels. The entrance to the
west seems to have disappeared.
~
