The Preparation Room~
   You find yourself in the preparation room, an area set aside for those
among you who wish to do battle. Various artifacts and weaponry line the walls
in honor of the great victors that have passed before you. Large mystical
runes lie to the east, creating a doorway into the onslaught. A peaceful aura
has settled around the room, allowing you to focus your thoughts on the battle
ahead...
~
