The Immortal Conference Room~
   You are in a huge stone room. The walls are made of huge grey-stone blocks
that seem to reach to the sky. In the center of the room is a huge wooden table
that is perfectly round. In the center of the table is a large fire that lights
most of the room. There are torches along the walls that provide even more
light. There are huge wooden chairs around the room that allow all of the
pantheon to assemble in some sort of order.
~
